Operator-directed on both monitors. The 4cuck/teapawt README lists seven public
instances (live on status.d420.net, scraping permitted): batch 1 = nitter.cf,
xitter.cf (untouched), nitter.gq, xitter.gq; batch 2 = teapawt.org, teapaw.org,
teapawt.net + new nitter.mizuki.st (TRIAL); batch 3 opens with the demoted
nitter.meowing.monster (run #4399: 502/429 while teapawt answered) and the
token-gated nitter.miningtcup.me. Order only, 27 -> 28, nothing deleted.
