@@ -1,5 +1,28 @@
 # Changelog — current entries
 
+## 2026-11-06 — X: nitter rotation #8 — the teapawt family leads, mizuki.st joins, meowing/miningtcup demoted
+
+- **What changed.** `gamexpress/config.py::DEFAULT_NITTER`, order only (27 → 28, nothing deleted),
+  operator-directed on both monitors. The `4cuck/teapawt` README (master, 2026-11-05) lists exactly
+  seven public instances — `nitter.cf`, `nitter.gq`, `xitter.cf`, `xitter.gq`, `teapaw.org`,
+  `teapawt.net`, `teapawt.org` — live on `status.d420.net` with explicit scraping permission; that
+  stack now leads. Batch 1: `nitter.cf`, `xitter.cf` (untouched), `nitter.gq`, `xitter.gq` (up from
+  batch 3, the seats they hold in News-Express). Batch 2: `teapawt.org`, `teapaw.org`, `teapawt.net`
+  (unchanged) + **new** `nitter.mizuki.st` (`TRIAL`: operator-verified bodies for `honkaistarrail`,
+  `HonkaiNA`, `Ananta_EN` on 2026-11-06; its feeds are generated by and link to
+  `nitter.meowing.monster`, i.e. that backend behind a different edge). Batch 3: `nitter.meowing.monster`
+  (**demoted** from slot 3 — run #4399, 2026-11-05 21:50 UTC: HTTP 502 on `honkaistarrail`, HTTP 429 on
+  `HonkaiNA` / `Ananta_EN` while teapawt answered), `nitter.miningtcup.me` (**demoted** from slot 4;
+  `TOKEN_GATED` / `NITTER_RSS_TOKEN` unchanged), `nitter.mie.foundation`, `nitter.freedit.eu`. Slot 13
+  down unchanged. `STATUS_MIRRORS` unchanged.
+- **Cost.** Batch 1 is single-origin now: a healthy run sends its 4 parallel probes per handle to the
+  teapawt origin (24 requests per run over six handles, 12 of them the quorum); a teapawt outage costs one
+  `NITTER_TIMEOUT` before batch 2 and a second before the independent bench in batch 3.
+- **Tests.** `test_rotation_8_teapawt_family_leads_mizuki_joins_meowing_and_miningtcup_demoted`
+  (exact batches, tail untouched, superset of rotation #7, token mapping); rotation #6/#7 guards keep
+  their lasting facts; the reserve-seat pacing probe watches `xitter.gq` (the new batch-1 reserve seat);
+  fleet-size pin 28/27 across README / `docs/SOURCES.md` / `docs/SECURITY.md`.
+
 ## 2026-11-05 — X: link / app card artwork is not tweet media
 
 - **What changed.** `sources/twitter.py::_fx_media` drops `pbs.twimg.com/card_img/…` entries
